    "enUS": {
      "dialogue": {
        "23baf5e885c0d2480b19": "Winterhoof? I hear he's living it up in Booty Bay.",
        "36e8f1b9e416e8668826": "Elder Stormbrow is most likely at the village of Goldshire in Elwynn Forest.",
        "3c7c8b96d893864ccd99": "Last I knew, Elder Starsong was in the Sunken Temple of the Swamp of Sorrows.",
        "48c491b478b60cfec92b": "In days long past, we lived for the hunt.  We hunted for glory, for honor...$B$BIs it so different now?"
      },
      "name": "Elder Skychaser",
      "translationMetadata": {
        "fields": {
